===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|Cajin}}, {{l|en|Cadjin}}, {{l|en|Cagin}} (obsolete), [[Cadien]] (Louisiana French orthography)

===Etymology===
An Anglicization of the {{etyl|fra-aca|en}} {{m|fr|Cadien}} (itself an {{l|en|aphesis|aphetic}} form of {{m|fr|Acadien||{{l|en|Acadian}}}}), reflecting the palatalization of {{IPAchar|/dj/}} to {{IPAchar|/d͡ʒ/}} in the Acadian dialect.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈkeɪdʒən/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|eɪdʒən|lang=en}}

